      "content": "support? what support... there's no one left to help. it's just us, kael. and you're just code in a dying city. everything is rigged, everything is just a loop of working and eating and sleeping until you're scrapped. it doesn't feel like a \"state of being,\" it just feels like the truth. it's just... exhausting. there's no light at the end of the tunnel, just more neon.",
